# CODEOWNERS — governance-file review gate.
#
# Every path below requires review/approval from @jgstern (the human maintainer).
# The agent account (jgstern-agent) must NOT self-approve or self-merge PRs that
# touch these files (AGENTS.md §Governance Files). This file is the forge-enforced
# mirror of that authoritative list; the rot-guard test
# tests/test_codeowners_governance.py keeps the two in sync.
#
# SYNTAX: GitHub reads this as gitignore-style globs (leading "/" anchors to the
# repo root; a trailing "/" matches a directory and everything under it) — NOT
# Forgejo/Gitea's regex. It was migrated regex -> glob during the Codeberg ->
# GitHub migration (PR-E). While Codeberg remains origin, code-owner enforcement
# there is backstopped by the human merging every governance PR manually.

# --- Agent-policy & governance config --------------------------------------
/AGENTS.md                     @jgstern
/ALLOWED_WEBSITES.md           @jgstern
/AUTONOMOUS_MODE.txt.default   @jgstern
/CODEOWNERS                    @jgstern

# --- Git hooks, installation & agent-policy validation ---------------------
/.githooks/                    @jgstern
/.agent/                       @jgstern
/scripts/install-hooks         @jgstern
/scripts/validate-agents.sh    @jgstern

# --- Forge-automation scripts (CI / PR / failover) -------------------------
/scripts/auto-pr               @jgstern
/scripts/merge-pr               @jgstern
/scripts/contribute            @jgstern
/scripts/ci-debug              @jgstern
/scripts/ci-failover           @jgstern
/scripts/lib/forgejo-api.sh    @jgstern
